.claude/

# Generated by `next dev` on every run (Next 16 agent rules); not part of the project
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# Capacitor output, for the Phase-0 spike and the Phase-2 shell alike: CocoaPods, Xcode build
# products and the synced web build are all regenerated by `pnpm build && npx cap sync ios`.
# `dist/` and `node_modules/` are already covered above.
# NOTE: ios/App/App/public/ is a COPY of dist/ that `cap sync` writes; committing it would mean
# two copies of the bundle in git, one of them silently stale.
# Podfile.lock IS committed (iOS release D14): an archive must be rebuildable from git with the
# exact pod versions it shipped with. dist-sourcemaps/ is where the iOS build moves its source
# maps so they never ship (apps/ios/vite.config.ts).
**/ios/App/Pods/
**/ios/App/App/public/
**/ios/DerivedData/
dist-sourcemaps/
**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/

# Playwright (pnpm e2e)
e2e-report/
test-results/
playwright/.cache/
